Title: MTG Codex Toolkit
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Florian", "Ricquier", email = "florian.ricquier@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Lightweight API and web interface to load and display MTG
    collections from SQLite, CSV, or text files. The package exposes a
    Plumber service plus a simple browser UI focused on ingestion and
    tabular preview.
